11
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:48,050
Flowchart completion question type has the following features.

12
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:52,130
Instead of completing a sentence like sentence completion

13
00:00:52,130 --> 00:00:55,360
or a table like table completion,

14
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:59,610
this question type requires us to complete a diagram or

15
00:00:59,610 --> 00:01:01,990
procedure within a word limit.

16
00:01:02,850 --> 00:01:06,630
This type of diagram summarizes information from the

17
00:01:06,630 --> 00:01:10,430
passage and represents a sequence of continuous events,

18
00:01:10,790 --> 00:01:13,830
actions, or steps in a process or the

19
00:01:13,830 --> 00:01:15,710
transformation of an object.

20
00:01:16,430 --> 00:01:19,570
And another important thing to remember is that

21
00:01:19,570 --> 00:01:22,910
the answers might not come in order as

22
00:01:22,910 --> 00:01:24,580
the information in the passage.

23
00:01:24,750 --> 00:01:27,490
Therefore, you need to read the passage carefully

24
00:01:27,490 --> 00:01:28,850
to find the answers.

25
00:01:29,750 --> 00:01:32,230
When dealing with this question type, you need

26
00:01:32,230 --> 00:01:34,030
to pay attention to the following things.

27
00:01:35,430 --> 00:01:37,270
Identify the order of questions.

28
00:01:38,090 --> 00:01:41,610
Locate paragraphs containing keywords of the flowchart.

29
00:01:42,690 --> 00:01:46,730
Moreover, similar to other completion question types, the

30
00:01:46,730 --> 00:01:49,730
answers are 100% taken from the passage

31
00:01:49,730 --> 00:01:52,310
within the word limit or not changed in

32
00:01:52,310 --> 00:01:53,490
terms of word form.

33
00:01:54,390 --> 00:01:57,630
Okay, we've had an overview of flowchart completion.

34
